| **facing_tolerance** | 60° — confirms visual attention toward the scaffolding |
| **False positive risk** | Low — player must both walk ~10 blocks toward the structure AND face the scaffolding |
| **False negative risk** | Low — 5-block radius and 60° tolerance are generous enough for natural approach angles |

